confirm.body:
Confirm the email of your Orchester account by opening this link within 24 hours:

{link}

If you did not sign up for Orchester just now, do not open the link; no account is created without it.

reset.body:
Choose a new password for your Orchester account by opening this link within 1 hour:

{link}

Setting a new password signs out every device of the account. If you did not ask for this, ignore this email; your password stays as it is.
